{"id":"633875","name":"咖喱饭","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/633875/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"中等大小洋葱","amount":"1个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1根"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"2个"},{"name":"咖喱","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黑胡椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"玉米淀粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡胸肉加胡椒粉、料酒、盐、玉米淀粉拌匀腌制20分钟以上。","img":"images/633875/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"土豆胡萝卜切丁。","img":"images/633875/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洋葱切丁。","img":"images/633875/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅热倒油加洋葱姜片爆香。","img":"images/633875/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加胡萝卜。","img":"images/633875/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入土豆、鸡肉炒匀。加一些黑胡椒。","img":"images/633875/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加水炖15分钟。","img":"images/633875/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"咖喱块。","img":"images/633875/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入锅中。","img":"images/633875/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"中大火10分钟汤汁粘稠即可。","img":"images/633875/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"装盘配米饭。","img":"images/633875/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"一起吃咖喱饭吧！","img":"images/633875/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}